    "name": "Figma Make",
    "descriptionZh": "Figma 的 AI 原型功能页：用提示词或设计上下文起一个能跑的原型，在画布上继续改，也能从本地代码库或 npm 包接进来，最后把产出拷回 Figma 画布或直接发布。",
    "takeawayZh": "提示词起可交互原型，再拷回 Figma 画布细调。",
    "noteZh": "浅色页面，正中先出现 Figma Make 的图标和一句「Prototype. Polish. Ship. Your ideas get real in Figma Make.」，底部压着一条绿色横幅，写着 AI add-ons now come with 2x more credits on Professional。往下分三块 Design and ship / Build prototypes with context / Move fluidly between design and code，feature 列表里能看到 Make on your local codebase (Beta)、Custom skills、MCP connectors，社区示例摆了 Travel App Prototype 和 Climate Dashboard。",
